{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch grasshoppers and collect them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grasshopper Collection is a full-fledged grasshopper-catching simulation game where you can enjoy the thrill of not knowing which grasshopper will appear next in this collection-style game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grasshoppers appear in the field, and with just your mouse and keyboard, you can catch them and store them in your Steam inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grasshopper has its own rarity. Every time you catch one, you\u2019ll receive an item based on the following probabilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Common: 90%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare: 4.5%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic: 0.49%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary: 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect them all and show off your collection on our official Discord!<br>\ud83d\udc49 </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372520?t=1749982813","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3372520?t=1749982813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372520/871f95f698a67b4c231dde7a8b29ef87841e5535/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749982813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3372520/871f95f698a67b4c231dde7a8b29ef87841e5535/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749982813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch grasshoppers and collect them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grasshopper Collection is a full-fledged grasshopper-catching simulation game where you can enjoy the thrill of not knowing which grasshopper will appear next in this collection-style game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra